From e2d3d4a73659cb65409eb0d84eed77c283c1cfb6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Bright <william.bright@imd-tec.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 14:26:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: qcs6490-imdt-sbc: Add AR1335 overlays for
 CSI0, CSI1, CSI3

Add AR1335 overlays for the carrier CSI0 (J40), CSI1 (J57) and CSI3
(J58) connectors, wired as on SoM 01.

The CSI4 connector (J59) gets no overlay. Its I2C only reaches the
SoM through the TCA9546A on the AON camera bus, and the SoM does not
connect those pads.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: William Bright <william.bright@imd-tec.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile             |  3 +
 .../qcom/qcs6490-imdt-sbc-ar1335-csi0.dtso    | 89 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../qcom/qcs6490-imdt-sbc-ar1335-csi1.dtso    | 89 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../qcom/qcs6490-imdt-sbc-ar1335-csi3.dtso    | 89 +++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 270 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs6490-imdt-sbc-ar1335-csi0.dtso
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs6490-imdt-sbc-ar1335-csi1.dtso
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs6490-imdt-sbc-ar1335-csi3.dtso

